OL,3,ABritish hacker who stole $11m through
OL,4,Atext message scheme jailed for six
OL,5,Ayears in US
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS prosecutors said the thefts had
OL,8,F"severe, life-altering consequences"
OL,9,Ffor victims and showed the growing
OL,10,Fthreat posed by online crime groups.
OL,12,FThe sentence brings to an end a
OL,13,Fyears-long international investigation
OL,14,Finvolving authorities in the UK, US,
OL,15,FSpain and Canada.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
