OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 begins worldwide
OL,4,Arelease after 13-year wait ` and the
OL,5,Aearly reviews are in
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe crime game, where players can
OL,8,Fexplore a fictional US state called
OL,9,FLeonida, features the series' first
OL,10,Fplayable female protagonist in a 3D
OL,11,Fsetting
OL,13,FA New Zealand gamer has already
OL,14,Ffinished the introduction - here are
OL,15,Fhis first thoughts (spoiler in post!)
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
